Revision: e0b5626af6b765d6f8fbe8978a394ffaab6a3f6f

Selective refresh of the existing subset and dependency closure for
rchd, rlzma, rflac, rinflate, rzstd, CRC32, CPU features and SPSC queues.
Upstream fallback implementations are preserved. The core uses its own
namespaced single-waiter eventcount backend in mednafen/.

Additive local APIs in formats/chd/rchd.c and include/formats/rchd.h:
- rchd_set_unit_bytes_hint: optional pre-v5 CD geometry, no default change.
- rchd_prepare_cd_ecc: initialize existing ECC tables before workers start.

